\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Thou art the Way: to Thee alone
\par From sin and death we flee:
\par And he who would the Father seek
\par Must seek Him, Lord, by Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thou art the Truth: Thy word alone
\par True wisdom can impart;
\par Thou only canst inform the mind,
\par And purify the heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thou art the Life: the rending tomb
\par Proclaims Thy conquering arm;
\par And those who put their trust in The,
\par Nor death nor hell shall harm.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Thou art the Way, the Truth, the Life:
\par Grant us that Way to know,
\par That Truth to keep, that Life to win,
\par Whose joys eternal flow.
\par                            Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

